Four</span>: To approve a proposal to grant discretionary authority to the Chairman of the Annual Meeting to adjourn the Annual Meeting,
if necessary, to solicit additional proxies in the event that there are not sufficient votes at the time of the Annual Meeting to approve
Proposal 3.</span></p>

